---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content="A small 2D game project in progress." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#171a18" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.lyanna.dev/game" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.lyanna.dev/game" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="game / lyanna.dev" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="A small 2D game project in progress." />
    <title>game / lyanna.dev</title>
  </head>
  <body class="game-page">
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Lyanna home">lyanna<span>.</span>dev</a>
      <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a class="active" href="/game" aria-current="page">game</a>
      </nav>
      <span class="status"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>prototype</span>
    </header>

    <main class="game-shell">
      <section class="game-intro">
        <p class="kicker">godot 4 / 2d / early build</p>
        <h1>A little world<br /><em>is waking.</em></h1>
        <p class="game-lede">A small incremental game about tending something strange, patient, and alive.</p>
        <div class="game-actions">
          <a class="contact" href="https://github.com/CannibalKush/lyanna-site/tree/main/godot" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View the skeleton <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <span class="build-label">build 0.0.1 / live web build</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="game-frame" aria-label="Game preview">
        <div class="frame-top"><span>pocket field</span><span>day 001</span></div>
        <div class="game-runtime">
          <iframe src="/godot/index.html" title="Pocket Field Godot game preview" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="frame-bottom"><span>◌ playable</span><span>Godot Web export / live preview</span></div>
      </section>

      <section class="game-notes">
        <div>
          <p class="kicker">the shape of it</p>
          <p class="note-copy">Explore a tiny place. Gather light. Make small changes. Return later and find that something continued without you.</p>
        </div>
        <dl class="tech-list">
          <div><dt>engine</dt><dd>Godot 4</dd></div>
          <div><dt>format</dt><dd>2D / incremental</dd></div>
          <div><dt>status</dt><dd>scaffolded</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <span>lyanna.dev / game</span>
      <a href="/">back home</a>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
